WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.780
This one is about videos, like this one.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.360
A video says things,
and burns them into pixels.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.100
Nobody reads them again,
even when they stop being true.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.150
This suite once showed a number
that was months out of date.

5
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.560
The code had moved on. The film had not.

6
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.487
Now every film is checked
against the code before it ships.

7
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.962
The secret: every number on screen
must point to the code that proves it.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.062
A number with nothing behind it is flagged
before anyone sees it.

9
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.087
This very film went
through the same check.

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

11
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
